# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Bytecode/cache Python: nunca deve entrar no hash de dependências
# (é regenerado a cada import e tornaria `dvc status`/`dvc repro` instável).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
